1
00:00:00,467 --> 00:00:02,621
15 November 1977. Bombay.

2
00:00:02,654 --> 00:00:07,600
Ek kapde ki company pehli baar public ke paas
aati hai.

3
00:00:07,633 --> 00:00:13,033
Share ka daam: ₹10. Poora issue: ₹2.82 crore.

4
00:00:13,067 --> 00:00:18,433
Lagbhag 58,000 log form bharte hain. Issue
saat guna bhar jaata hai.

5
00:00:18,467 --> 00:00:21,033
Company ka naam: Reliance.

6
00:00:21,067 --> 00:00:28,567
49 saal baad. October 2026. Usi group ki ek
company: Jio Platforms.

7
00:00:28,600 --> 00:00:35,100
Issue: ₹30,213 crore. Form nahi, phone pe UPI
se.

8
00:00:35,133 --> 00:00:39,767
Paisa badla. Technology badli. Par raasta wahi
hai.

9
00:00:39,800 --> 00:00:43,823
Har IPO, chahe Jio ho ya aapke shehar ki
chhoti company,

10
00:00:43,856 --> 00:00:45,800
isi safar se guzarta hai.

11
00:00:45,833 --> 00:00:50,833
Aaj woh poora safar: ek idea se lekar listing
ki ghanti tak.

12
00:00:50,867 --> 00:00:55,367
Aur raaste mein woh sawaal, jo har application
se pehle poochne chahiye.

13
00:00:57,567 --> 00:01:00,133
Shuru karte hain ek chai ki dukaan se.

14
00:01:00,167 --> 00:01:05,000
Raju ki chai. Ek dukaan, phir paanch, phir
pachaas.

15
00:01:05,033 --> 00:01:10,433
Ab Raju ko 500 dukaanein kholni hain. Chahiye
lagbhag ₹100 crore.

16
00:01:10,467 --> 00:01:13,133
Paisa aaye kahan se? Teen raaste.

17
00:01:13,167 --> 00:01:17,767
Ek: apni bachat. Par itni bachat kisi ki nahi
hoti.

18
00:01:17,800 --> 00:01:23,900
Do: bank se loan. Par interest har mahine dena
hai, chai bike ya na bike.

19
00:01:23,933 --> 00:01:29,433
Teen: partner dhoondo. Woh paisa dega, badle
mein company ka hissa lega.

20
00:01:29,833 --> 00:01:33,767
Raju partner chunta hai. Pehle family aur
dost.

21
00:01:33,800 --> 00:01:39,367
Phir bade investors: angel investors, venture
capital, private equity funds.

22
00:01:39,400 --> 00:01:43,567
Har partner ko milte hain shares. Company ke
chhote-chhote tukde.

23
00:01:43,600 --> 00:01:48,467
Par yeh sab private hai. Yeh shares koi bazaar
mein khareed-bech nahi sakta.

24
00:01:48,867 --> 00:01:51,233
Phir ek din do cheezein hoti hain.

25
00:01:51,267 --> 00:01:55,600
Company ko itna paisa chahiye ki private
partner kam pad jaate hain.

26
00:01:55,633 --> 00:01:59,767
Aur purane partners kehte hain: hamein apna
hissa bech ke nikalna hai.

27
00:01:59,800 --> 00:02:03,867
Tab company poore desh se kehti hai: aao,
partner bano.

28
00:02:03,900 --> 00:02:07,535
Isi ko kehte hain IPO. Initial Public
Offering.

29
00:02:07,568 --> 00:02:10,633
Pehli baar, public ko shares ka offer.

30
00:02:10,667 --> 00:02:13,367
IPO ka paisa do jagah jaa sakta hai.

31
00:02:13,400 --> 00:02:18,467
Fresh issue: naye shares bante hain. Paisa
company ke paas, kaam ke liye.

32
00:02:18,500 --> 00:02:24,700
Offer for sale: purane partners apne shares
bechte hain. Paisa unki jeb mein.

33
00:02:24,733 --> 00:02:29,314
Jio ka IPO poora fresh issue tha: 27 crore
naye shares.

34
00:02:29,347 --> 00:02:32,567
Aur bada hissa loan chukane ke liye.

35
00:02:34,767 --> 00:02:38,800
Par IPO laana dukaan pe board lagane jaisa
aasaan nahi.

36
00:02:38,833 --> 00:02:44,467
Company hire karti hai merchant bankers. Inka
kaam: poora IPO chalana.

37
00:02:44,500 --> 00:02:50,033
Saath mein lawyers, auditors, registrar.
Mahino ki taiyaari.

38
00:02:50,433 --> 00:02:53,600
Sabse bada kaam: ek mota document.

39
00:02:53,633 --> 00:02:58,500
Naam: DRHP. Draft Red Herring Prospectus.

40
00:02:58,533 --> 00:03:03,954
Red herring kyun? Aise document ke cover pe
laal rang mein chetavni hoti thi:

41
00:03:03,988 --> 00:03:05,467
yeh final nahi hai.

42
00:03:05,500 --> 00:03:08,733
Kyunki isme abhi daam aur taareekh nahi hote.

43
00:03:08,767 --> 00:03:14,467
Baaki sab hota hai. Company kya karti hai,
kitna kamaati hai, kitna karz hai.

44
00:03:14,500 --> 00:03:19,400
Promoters kaun hain. Kaunse court cases chal
rahe hain. Aur risks kya hain.

45
00:03:19,433 --> 00:03:24,600
Aur sabse kaam ka section: objects of the
issue. Paisa kahan jaayega.

46
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:29,533
Yeh DRHP jaata hai SEBI ke paas. Share market
ka regulator.

47
00:03:29,567 --> 00:03:33,800
Aur aap bhi ise padh sakte ho. SEBI ki website
pe, bilkul free.

48
00:03:33,833 --> 00:03:37,162
SEBI sawaal poochta hai. Company jawaab deti
hai.

49
00:03:37,195 --> 00:03:39,867
Phir SEBI deta hai apne observations.

50
00:03:39,900 --> 00:03:42,967
Ab ek badi galatfehmi door kar lo.

51
00:03:43,000 --> 00:03:46,900
SEBI yeh nahi batata ki company achchhi hai ya
buri.

52
00:03:46,933 --> 00:03:51,767
SEBI dekhta hai ki zaroori baatein saaf-saaf
likhi hain ya nahi.

53
00:03:51,800 --> 00:03:58,067
Toh "SEBI ne approve kiya, toh safe hai"?
Galat. Faisla aapka hai.

54
00:03:58,100 --> 00:04:03,267
Observations ke baad company ke paas ek saal
hota hai IPO kholne ke liye.

55
00:04:05,467 --> 00:04:07,700
Ab sawaal: share kitne ka?

56
00:04:07,733 --> 00:04:12,289
Bankers bade investors se milte hain. Demand
ka andaza lagate hain.

57
00:04:12,323 --> 00:04:14,100
Ise kehte hain roadshow.

58
00:04:14,133 --> 00:04:18,667
Phir aata hai RHP. Ab dates bhi, aur price
band bhi.

59
00:04:18,700 --> 00:04:25,467
Price band matlab ek range. Jio ka: ₹1,065 se
₹1,119.

60
00:04:25,500 --> 00:04:30,500
Is range ke andar log boli lagate hain. Isliye
ise kehte hain book building.

61
00:04:30,533 --> 00:04:33,567
Aam investor aksar cut-off chunta hai. Matlab:

62
00:04:33,600 --> 00:04:36,467
jo bhi final daam ho, main taiyaar hoon.

63
00:04:36,867 --> 00:04:40,033
Aur shares milte hain lot mein. Ek-ek nahi.

64
00:04:40,067 --> 00:04:45,133
Rules ke hisaab se ek lot lagbhag ₹10 se 15
hazaar ka hota hai.

65
00:04:45,167 --> 00:04:51,133
Jio ka lot: 12 shares. Upper band pe ₹13,428.

66
00:04:51,533 --> 00:04:56,700
Issue khulne se ek din pehle aate hain bade
khiladi: anchor investors.

67
00:04:56,733 --> 00:05:00,800
Mutual funds, insurance companies, videshi
funds.

68
00:05:00,833 --> 00:05:06,633
Jio mein 212 anchors ne milke ₹8,110 crore
lagaye.

69
00:05:06,667 --> 00:05:11,667
Inka kaam: bharosa dikhana. Ki bade log bhi is
daam pe taiyaar hain.

70
00:05:11,700 --> 00:05:12,715
Par ek shart.

71
00:05:12,749 --> 00:05:18,367
Anchors ke aadhe shares 30 din, aur aadhe 90
din tak bik nahi sakte.

72
00:05:18,400 --> 00:05:20,967
Taaki listing ke din hi bhaag na jaayein.

73
00:05:21,367 --> 00:05:25,100
Ab baaki shares ka batwara. Ise ek cake
samjho.

74
00:05:25,133 --> 00:05:30,333
50% bade institutions ke liye. Inhe kehte hain
QIB.

75
00:05:30,367 --> 00:05:36,867
15% bade investors ke liye, jo ₹2 lakh se
zyada lagate hain. NII.

76
00:05:36,900 --> 00:05:42,933
Aur 35% aapke liye. Retail investor, jo ₹2
lakh tak lagate hain.

77
00:05:42,967 --> 00:05:46,131
Yeh batwara profit wali companies ka hai.

78
00:05:46,164 --> 00:05:51,333
Jo company abhi profit nahi dikha paati, usme
retail ko sirf 10%.

79
00:05:51,367 --> 00:05:55,833
Kyunki wahan risk zyada hai. Rule khud aapko
bacha raha hai.

80
00:05:58,033 --> 00:06:03,967
Ab aata hai bada din. Issue khulta hai, kam se
kam teen working din ke liye.

81
00:06:04,000 --> 00:06:06,933
Jio ka: 21 se 23 October.

82
00:06:07,333 --> 00:06:11,633
Dadaji ke zamane mein? Bank jao, form bharo,
cheque lagao.

83
00:06:11,667 --> 00:06:15,209
Shares mile toh ghar kaagaz ka certificate
aata tha.

84
00:06:15,243 --> 00:06:18,300
Na mile, toh refund ka cheque, hafton baad.

85
00:06:18,333 --> 00:06:23,967
Reliance ke 1977 wale IPO ke baad, listing
mein lagbhag do mahine lage the.

86
00:06:24,367 --> 00:06:29,067
Aaj? Broker app kholo, bid lagao, UPI pe
mandate approve karo.

87
00:06:29,100 --> 00:06:35,033
Aur ek baat jo bahut log nahi jaante: paisa
kat-ta nahi. Sirf block hota hai.

88
00:06:35,067 --> 00:06:39,697
Is system ka naam hai ASBA. Paisa aapke
account mein hi rehta hai.

89
00:06:39,731 --> 00:06:42,267
Bas aap use kharch nahi kar sakte.

90
00:06:42,300 --> 00:06:47,100
Shares mile toh paisa kat-ta hai. Na mile, toh
block khul jaata hai.

91
00:06:47,500 --> 00:06:52,633
Teen din exchange pe live dikhta hai: kis
category mein kitni demand.

92
00:06:52,667 --> 00:06:58,767
Ise kehte hain subscription. Jitne shares the,
usse kitne guna boli lagi.

93
00:06:58,800 --> 00:07:08,567
Jio: overall lagbhag 22 guna. QIB 70 guna se
zyada. Retail lagbhag 2.7 guna.

94
00:07:08,600 --> 00:07:12,567
Yaani bade investors ki line, aapki line se
kahin lambi thi.

95
00:07:12,600 --> 00:07:20,403
In dino ek aur bazaar chalta hai, bina kisi
niyam ke: grey market. Uska number:

96
00:07:20,437 --> 00:07:20,967
GMP.

97
00:07:21,000 --> 00:07:26,033
GMP unofficial hai. Uspe poori video alag se
hai.

98
00:07:28,233 --> 00:07:33,533
Teen din khatam. Is din ko kehte hain T day.
Ab ghadi chalti hai.

99
00:07:33,567 --> 00:07:40,033
SEBI ka niyam: T+3. Issue band hone ke teen
working din mein listing.

100
00:07:40,433 --> 00:07:45,233
Pehla kaam, T+1: allotment. Shares kisko
milenge?

101
00:07:45,267 --> 00:07:48,283
Retail mein demand zyada ho, toh niyam hai:

102
00:07:48,317 --> 00:07:51,467
zyada se zyada logon ko, kam se kam ek lot.

103
00:07:51,500 --> 00:07:56,400
Isliye hoti hai lottery. Computer se, stock
exchange ki nigrani mein.

104
00:07:56,433 --> 00:07:57,976
Aur twist yeh hai:

105
00:07:58,009 --> 00:08:03,800
aapne 1 lot lagaya ho ya 14, lottery mein
aapki ek hi parchi hai.

106
00:08:03,833 --> 00:08:09,044
Jio mein retail ke liye lagbhag 8.5 crore
shares the. 12 ka lot.

107
00:08:09,078 --> 00:08:13,800
Yaani zyada se zyada lagbhag 70 lakh log jeet
sakte the.

108
00:08:13,833 --> 00:08:17,365
Usse zyada log apply karein, toh har kisi ko
nahi milega.

109
00:08:17,399 --> 00:08:19,500
Chahe paisa kitna bhi lagaya ho.

110
00:08:19,533 --> 00:08:26,100
Status dekhna hai? Registrar ki site pe, ya
NSE, BSE pe. PAN daalo, bas.

111
00:08:26,500 --> 00:08:32,400
T+2: mila toh shares aapke demat mein. Nahi
mila, toh UPI block release.

112
00:08:32,433 --> 00:08:36,306
Aaj India mein 20 crore se zyada demat
accounts hain.

113
00:08:36,340 --> 00:08:39,267
Kaagaz ka certificate ab itihaas hai.

114
00:08:41,467 --> 00:08:46,900
T+3: listing ka din. Par share seedha bazaar
mein nahi kudta.

115
00:08:46,933 --> 00:08:52,967
Pehle ek special pre-open session. Subah 9 se
9:45 tak, sirf orders lagte hain.

116
00:08:53,000 --> 00:08:58,400
Phir exchange woh daam dhoondta hai, jahan
sabse zyada shares ka sauda ho sake.

117
00:08:58,433 --> 00:09:03,067
Wahi hai listing price. Aur 10 baje se normal
trading.

118
00:09:03,467 --> 00:09:09,467
Aur haan, ghanti bhi bajti hai. Promoters,
bankers, cameras. Bada jashn.

119
00:09:09,500 --> 00:09:15,633
Par IPO price aur listing price ka farak hi
aapka pehla munafa ya nuksaan hai.

120
00:09:15,667 --> 00:09:22,700
Bajaj Housing Finance: IPO ₹70, listing ₹150.
Doguna se zyada.

121
00:09:22,733 --> 00:09:29,867
Hyundai Motor India: IPO ₹1,960, listing
₹1,934. Neeche.

122
00:09:29,900 --> 00:09:34,433
LIC: listing pe lagbhag 8% neeche.

123
00:09:34,467 --> 00:09:39,933
Matlab bada naam, guarantee nahi. Listing sirf
ek din ka mood hai.

124
00:09:42,133 --> 00:09:46,867
Listing ke baad bhi kahani khatam nahi. Ab
kuch taale khulte hain.

125
00:09:46,900 --> 00:09:52,667
30 din baad anchors ke aadhe shares free. 90
din baad, baaki aadhe.

126
00:09:52,700 --> 00:09:55,900
Purane private investors ke shares: 6 mahine
baad.

127
00:09:55,933 --> 00:10:01,291
Aur promoters? Unka kam se kam 20% hissa, 18
mahine tak lock.

128
00:10:01,324 --> 00:10:03,667
Kuch case mein teen saal.

129
00:10:03,700 --> 00:10:07,035
Taale khulte hain toh bechne wale badh sakte
hain.

130
00:10:07,069 --> 00:10:10,233
Yeh dates RHP mein pehle se likhi hoti hain.

131
00:10:10,633 --> 00:10:14,500
Aur company ki zindagi badal jaati hai. Ab woh
public hai.

132
00:10:14,533 --> 00:10:19,333
Har teen mahine results. Har badi khabar
exchange ko batani padti hai.

133
00:10:19,367 --> 00:10:25,233
Aur aap? Ab aap malik ho. Chhote se, par
malik. Voting ka haq bhi.

134
00:10:27,433 --> 00:10:32,000
Toh agla IPO aaye, toh apply karne se pehle
yeh paanch sawaal.

135
00:10:32,033 --> 00:10:34,709
Ek: paisa kiske paas jaa raha hai?

136
00:10:34,742 --> 00:10:38,700
Company ke paas, ya purane partners ki jeb
mein?

137
00:10:38,733 --> 00:10:43,721
Do: paisa kis kaam aayega? Naya business, ya
purana loan?

138
00:10:43,755 --> 00:10:46,267
Objects of the issue padho.

139
00:10:46,300 --> 00:10:51,933
Teen: company kamaati hai? Profit badh raha
hai, ya karz?

140
00:10:51,967 --> 00:10:56,818
Chaar: daam sahi hai? RHP mein "basis for
offer price" dekho.

141
00:10:56,851 --> 00:10:59,467
Doosri companies se tulna karo.

142
00:10:59,500 --> 00:11:01,986
Paanch: main kyun apply kar raha hoon?

143
00:11:02,019 --> 00:11:05,533
Listing ke ek din ke liye, ya paanch saal ke
liye?

144
00:11:07,733 --> 00:11:10,167
Ek baar, poora safar.

145
00:11:10,200 --> 00:11:14,967
Partner chahiye. Bankers. DRHP. SEBI ke
sawaal.

146
00:11:15,000 --> 00:11:18,400
Price band. Anchors. Teen din ki boli.

147
00:11:18,433 --> 00:11:24,967
T+1 lottery. T+2 demat. T+3 ghanti.

148
00:11:25,000 --> 00:11:30,700
1977 mein bhi yahi raasta tha. Aur agle IPO ka
bhi yahi hoga.

149
00:11:30,733 --> 00:11:35,533
IPO lottery ka ticket nahi. Ek company mein
hissedaari hai.

150
00:11:35,933 --> 00:11:41,060
Ghar mein jo bhi pehli baar IPO bhar raha hai,
beta, papa ya dadi,

151
00:11:41,094 --> 00:11:42,400
unhe yeh bhejo.

152
00:11:42,433 --> 00:11:46,633
Yeh video sirf samjhane ke liye hai.
Investment advice nahi.

153
00:11:46,667 --> 00:11:50,033
Paisa samjho. Yeh hai Money Theory.

